[0.000, "o", "\r\n==============================================================================\r\n6.  A table nobody has reviewed\r\n------------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\nClassification is a tag like any other. Unverified means zero rows,\r\nnot raw values, so an unreviewed table is dark rather than open.\r\n\r\n"]
